(7133876, 1090973, 30364, '<td valign="top">I loved that game as a kid.  Do kids still play it?  I suppose now there''d be an ''enabler'' to hold the ladders for the player (the participant?), and a ''carer'' for when you slid down a serpent onto your ass.  Do kids still have asses?  Are kids still kids?  Oh, bugger, it''s a Droste effect comment.  I loved that game as a kid, etc.</td>', 'I loved that game as a kid.  Do kids still play it?  I suppose now there''d be an ''enabler'' to hold the ladders for the player (the participant?), and a ''carer'' for when you slid down a serpent onto your ass.  Do kids still have asses?  Are kids still kids?  Oh, bugger, it''s a Droste effect comment.  I loved that game as a kid, etc.', '2013-11-23 03:01:59.000000', NULL, 0),
