(7133938, 1091885, 161988, '<td valign="top">You must be wondering why this scored so low.  Well guess what?  That makes two of us.  Very unique and pleasing shot.</td>', 'You must be wondering why this scored so low.  Well guess what?  That makes two of us.  Very unique and pleasing shot.', '2013-11-23 10:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7133949, 1092068, 96751, '<td valign="top">Staying with the norm, the normal, the usual, we create a rut, along which we trudge, unaware of anything but the direction of the rut, towards more of the same. To chance veering off the rut, we risk staggering, tripping, falling. Maybe dying. Do we have the courage? Should we take the risk, out there where maybe no one will ever see us, rescue us? Or is it us rescuing everyone else, as we try to forge a new path?<br/> <br/>Very provocative, and beautifully created, Christophe. Your conceptual talent is staggering.</td>', 'Staying with the norm, the normal, the usual, we create a rut, along which we trudge, unaware of anything but the direction of the rut, towards more of the same. To chance veering off the rut, we risk staggering, tripping, falling. Maybe dying. Do we have the courage? Should we take the risk, out there where maybe no one will ever see us, rescue us? Or is it us rescuing everyone else, as we try to forge a new path? Very provocative, and beautifully created, Christophe. Your conceptual talent is staggering.', '2013-11-23 11:05:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7133951, 1092165, 96751, '<td valign="top">"I was going to go somewhere lovely for this shoot"<br/> <br/>NEWS FLASH: Your back yard IS lovely!!!!<br/> <br/>Congrats, Brennan. My mind melts at the concept! Superbly done. And you''re so cute!</td>', '"I was going to go somewhere lovely for this shoot" NEWS FLASH: Your back yard IS lovely!!!! Congrats, Brennan. My mind melts at the concept! Superbly done. And you''re so cute!', '2013-11-23 11:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7133952, 1091727, 96751, '<td valign="top">Classy, classy, classy! Congrats on the ribbon. And a steel mantle? Uber cool</td>', 'Classy, classy, classy! Congrats on the ribbon. And a steel mantle? Uber cool', '2013-11-23 11:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7133953, 1092107, 96751, '<td valign="top">Makes my eyes feel funny!!!! I''m sure Escher felt that way working on his stuff :-)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM. Great image</td>', 'Makes my eyes feel funny!!!! I''m sure Escher felt that way working on his stuff :-) Congrats on the HM. Great image', '2013-11-23 11:12:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7133954, 1092192, 96751, '<td valign="top">Classic! And the entire right third of the image would make a sensational still life on its own - those flowers are incredible. Congrats on the HM, Mary Ann</td>', 'Classic! And the entire right third of the image would make a sensational still life on its own - those flowers are incredible. Congrats on the HM, Mary Ann', '2013-11-23 11:14:03.000000', NULL, 0),
