(7133963, 1092165, 30049, '<td valign="top">The sheep pen is just around the corner isn''t it?  You did your darnedest to keep ''em corralled!  Congrats on a great image and kudos for leading the team with yet another outstanding piece of work.</td>', 'The sheep pen is just around the corner isn''t it?  You did your darnedest to keep ''em corralled!  Congrats on a great image and kudos for leading the team with yet another outstanding piece of work.', '2013-11-23 11:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
