(7133974, 1091901, 30861, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a 10, Margaret, but never got back to comment. I''m really surprised it didn''t ribbon. Maybe the sheer regularity of it turned some people off? Though I think that''s a lot of why it works so well. Anyway, congratulations. Wonderful shot.</td>', 'I gave this one a 10, Margaret, but never got back to comment. I''m really surprised it didn''t ribbon. Maybe the sheer regularity of it turned some people off? Though I think that''s a lot of why it works so well. Anyway, congratulations. Wonderful shot.', '2013-11-23 12:12:15.000000', NULL, 0);
