(7134061, 1092068, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skewsme:</b></div><hr/><i> Just wondering, are they books, or bricks with lips? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Bricks, but I changed the proportions of the original photos to make them narrower, and suggest book shapes.</td>', 'Originally posted by skewsme: Just wondering, are they books, or bricks with lips?   Bricks, but I changed the proportions of the original photos to make them narrower, and suggest book shapes.', '2013-11-23 17:54:19.000000', NULL, 0),
