(7134122, 1091885, 63218, '<td valign="top">Hah! I should''ve known this was you, with the circular-ish shapes. I like the complimentary curve of the seal''s back with the other seal''s neck, &amp; the curving shapes. Well done. This is a lot of fun to look at.</td>', 'Hah! I should''ve known this was you, with the circular-ish shapes. I like the complimentary curve of the seal''s back with the other seal''s neck, & the curving shapes. Well done. This is a lot of fun to look at.', '2013-11-23 20:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
